  "project_description": "This module creates bundles to represent common named entities in archival description (Corporate Bodies, Families, and Persons) as well as subject terms. It also provides several field types - EDTF Dates, Authority Links, and Typed Relations - that assist in library and archival description.\n\n It is intended to be used in conjunction with both the ArchivesSpace/Drupal 8 Integration project and Islandora , though it has no dependencies on either and can be used on its own.\n\n Development is done on Github.com so please contribute PRs there rather than MRs here.",
